<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-01T21:18:42.489Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 21:18:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have stepped up cross-border attacks, launching drones toward Mecca that Saudi air defenses intercepted and striking Saudi airports, while a Saudi-led coalition precision operation hit Houthi targets in Yemen. The Houthis are reported to be using Russian satellites to coordinate strikes, and a cargo vessel bound for Pakistan was targeted near the Hormuz Strait. UN investigators are probing the death of a staff member in Houthi custody, and fighting around Taiz and Aden has displaced 290,000 people, including pregnant women. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxONGlqc0RGdTdlNDBPOGJOQmY0R1ZuRVFkcVRZQ0JKM2dRbkdIem5zaVhwbUdndU9jclFyanViWDZIdS1xdE1NRTBQeWhLZkc1S2pZMU1WQ2lJUnFKRkxyYnZEa0Iyc3ctdzJtamx6RHFJSldaenNhZ2NMZmhLNjJKak55UVFyTkR0c3VDZGlrQTU2TDhaWVhILTV1QjJKcGNjTS03VXFyYjExdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQQ3lDN1Z2S05VTWVvS0M2STlDSTNkNGJuaUJ6UkhBNGRkbVduYmJSSkNyT0QwUWx5Z2hRaEN0SUVJSURVUlByc0xpTERlQWRCR3NPYkNlaDEwTVl3UmRIUTU3YnBUTHNPWUVUZUs2N09TenFLT3A2dWs1SngzaFAtWmF0SVFzc3hHc0JHMEVTa2tpaWRSWEpfNF9tNVdzb2k1anVRVWtpRFBTaWlhMFQ0emFvOWJiLVBfVmtqV3hn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt